          "attribute": "question/problem",
          "value": "Given that the minor of $a_{23}$ is $5,$ find all the possible values of $k$ in the matrix\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}k & 3 & -1 \\\\ -5 & 2 & 7 \\\\ -1 & 2k & -6\\end{aligned}]\n$$",
